  "releaseNotes": "Updated methods to use Transactions. Added property for ConnectionTimeoutSeconds that user can set.  Add additional constructor without IConfiguration.  Will now only set the ConnectionString from IConfiguration if ConnectionStringName is passed as null.  Will now only set the ConnectionTimeoutSeconds if a value is passed, otherwise user can set their own once and pass as null into the method.  ConnectionName parameter is now nullable in all methods. Added Dependency Injection methods.",
